return ['domain'=>'tranzly','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_CN','project-id-version'=>'tranzly','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-26T07:20:29+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-26T07:20:29+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Tranzly'=>'Tranzly','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/tranzly'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/tranzly','The foundation release of the rebuilt Tranzly: a list of your site\'s languages, a language switcher block, and the language API other plugins read.'=>'重构版 Tranzly 的基础版本：包含您网站的语言列表、语言切换器区块，以及供其他插件读取的语言 API。','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','AI providers'=>'AI 提供商','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'ChatGPT 的创造者。一款表现全面的优秀工具。','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Claude 的创造者。擅长写作与严谨推理。','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Google 的 Gemini 模型。快速且经济实惠。','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'一家拥有快速且经济实惠模型的欧洲人工智能公司。','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'擅长写作和代码的高性价比模型。','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'一个密钥即可调用来自多家不同提供商的模型。','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'任何像 OpenAI 的 API 一样运行的服务，包括在您自己的计算机或服务器上运行的模型。','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'通用（当未设置更具体的内容时使用）','Writing and rewriting'=>'编写和重写','Translation'=>'翻译','Code and CSS'=>'代码和 CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'抱歉，您无权访问此页面。','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'这些设置由使用它们的每个插件共享：%s。','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'您的密钥已在此网站的数据库中加密，且只会发送至您选择的服务提供商——绝不会发送给我们。','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'第 1 步（共 2 步）：选择 AI 提供商','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'您自备密钥，因此您直接向服务商支付实际使用的费用。拿不准？以下任意一种都可以，您以后还可以添加更多。','Next'=>'下一步','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'第 2 步，共 2 步：连接 %s','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'请输入您的 OpenAI 兼容服务的地址，以 /v1 结尾。仅当服务要求时才需要密钥。','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'打开 %s 并登录（或创建一个免费账户）。','the %s API keys page'=>'%s API 密钥页面','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'创建一个新密钥并复制它。','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'将其粘贴在下方，然后点击“保存并测试”。我们会发送一个微小的请求以检查其是否正常工作。','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'大多数提供商需要在账户中有少许余额后，密钥才能生效：%s。','add credit'=>'添加额度','← Choose a different provider'=>'← 选择其他服务商','Address'=>'地址','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'已保存的密钥以……%s结尾 — 请粘贴新密钥以替换它','Key (optional)'=>'密钥（可选）','API key'=>'API 密钥','Save and test'=>'保存并测试','Providers'=>'服务商','Provider'=>'服务商','Status'=>'状态','Key'=>'密钥','Get a key'=>'获取密钥','Test'=>'测试','Remove'=>'移除','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'保存自较新版本的插件：请更新此插件，或重新输入密钥。','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'已保存的密钥无法再打开（网站的安全密钥已更改）。请重新输入。','Not connected'=>'未连接','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'已连接 — 上次测试通过 %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'上一次测试失败：%s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'已连接 — 尚未测试','Which model to use'=>'使用哪个模型','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ 表示我们针对该任务的推荐。此列表包含您的密钥可以使用的所有模型，由提供商实时读取。','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— 建议服务商使用 —','Save models'=>'保存模型','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'从提供商处刷新模型列表','best quality'=>'最高品质','lowest cost'=>'最低费用','fastest'=>'最快','Add a model yourself'=>'自行添加模型','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'今天发布了新模型？输入其准确名称即可直接使用。','Model name'=>'模型名称','Add model'=>'添加模型','Recommended models list'=>'推荐模型列表','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'无法验证推荐模型列表，因此未显示任何推荐。请重新安装插件，或在下方开启每日更新。','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'正在使用的列表发布于 %s。每次插件更新都会带来一个新的列表。','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'每天也请查看一次 Zinn Digital® 以获取更新的列表。','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'仅发送纯下载请求：不包含密钥、网站地址，也没有关于您内容的任何信息。该列表经过签名，签名检查未通过的列表将被忽略。','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'最后检查于 %1$s：%2$s。','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'保存并在开启时立即检查','a newer list was installed'=>'已安装更新的列表','already up to date'=>'已经是最新版本','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'下载未能通过签名检查，已被忽略','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'无法连接到 Zinn Digital®；当前列表将继续使用','turned off'=>'已关闭','Open'=>'打开','Check their status page'=>'查看他们的状态页面','Open your billing page'=>'打开您的账单页面','Open your API keys page'=>'打开您的 API 密钥页面','Open the AI settings'=>'打开 AI 设置','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'很抱歉，您没有权限执行此操作。','Unknown provider.'=>'未知服务商。','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'请输入您的服务地址，例如 http://localhost:11434/v1。','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'这看起来不像 API 密钥。请重新复制，不要包含空格。','Paste your API key first.'=>'请先粘贴您的API密钥。','Key removed.'=>'密钥已移除。','Models saved.'=>'模型已保存。','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'请输入模型的准确名称，例如照供应商文档中所写的那样。','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'已添加 %s。请在“使用哪个模型”下进行选择。','Model removed.'=>'模型已移除。','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'每日更新已关闭。将使用插件自带的列表。','Checked: %s.'=>'已选中：%s。','Model lists refreshed.'=>'模型列表已刷新。','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'您的 AI 密钥已被某个插件的较新版本保存。请更新此插件，或在 AI 设置中重新输入密钥。','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'您保存的 AI 密钥已无法打开（该网站的安全密钥已更改）。请在 AI 设置中重新输入。','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'AI 尚未设置。请在 AI 设置中添加 AI 提供商的密钥。','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'未为此任务选择模型。请在 AI 设置中选择一个。','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'此版本的插件不支持该 AI 提供商。','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'此网站无法连接到您的 AI 服务。请检查该服务是否正在运行，以及您的网络服务器是否能够访问其地址（托管网站无法访问您自己计算机上的服务）。','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'此网站无法访问 %s。请检查其状态页面；如果服务器运行正常，则可能是您的主机屏蔽了外发连接，或者地址输入错误。','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s 表示您的账户已无可用额度或配额。请在其账户中添加额度或提高限制，然后重试。','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s 未接受您的密钥。它可能输入错误、已被吊销或已过期。请创建一个新密钥并将其粘贴在此处。','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s 拒绝了针对您的密钥的此请求。该密钥可能无法访问此模型或功能，或者您的账户需要验证。','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'您的密钥无法通过 %2$s 使用模型 "%1$s"。请在 AI 设置中选择另一个模型。','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s 正在限制您的密钥发送请求的速度。请稍候一分钟再试，或者提高您与他们的速率限制。','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s 目前遇到问题（对方服务器出现故障或过载）。您的设置没有问题。请稍后重试。','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'AI 请求因未知原因失败。请重试；如果问题仍然存在，请将以下详细信息提供给客服支持。','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'AI 提供商返回了此插件无法读取的格式。请重试；如果问题持续存在，请选择其他模型或联系支持人员。','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'自定义（兼容 OpenAI）','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'请先为该服务商保存一个密钥。','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'您的密钥有效，但提供商未列出可用的文本模型。请在下方自行添加模型。','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'已连接：%1$s 使用 %2$s 接听。您的人工智能功能已准备就绪。','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'您的用户角色不允许在本网站上使用人工智能。请联系管理员。','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'此网站已达到每月的 AI 消费限额。管理员可以在 AI 设置中提高限额。','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'本网站已达到每月的 AI 请求额度上限。管理员可以在 AI 设置中提高此额度。','Usage and cost'=>'使用量与费用','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'日志、限制和角色权限适用于通过以下方式使用的 AI：%s。','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'费用为大致估算，根据公开价格计算；没有已知价格的型号计为零。','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'本月：%1$s 个请求，约占 %2$s。','When'=>'当','Who'=>'谁','Used for'=>'用于','Model'=>'模型','Tokens in / out'=>'输入 / 输出','About'=>'关于','Result'=>'结果','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'尚未发起任何 AI 请求。','Done'=>'已完成','Limits and permissions'=>'限制与权限','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'每月支出限额（US dollars）','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'留空则表示不设限制。当大致费用达到该限额时，AI将在这个月的剩余时间内停止服务。','Monthly request limit'=>'每月请求数限制','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'留空则表示无限制。','Who may use AI'=>'谁可以使用人工智能','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'不勾选则允许所有能够使用该插件功能的人使用人工智能。管理员始终可以使用。','Save limits and permissions'=>'保存限制和权限','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'限制和权限已保存。','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'此插件副本中缺少管理屏幕的脚本。请从发布的程序包中重新安装。','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'此屏幕需要 JavaScript。','Choose a language'=>'选择语言','Upgrade'=>'升级','Pricing'=>'价格','Start Trial'=>'开始试用','Account'=>'账户','Contact Us'=>'联系我们','Affiliation'=>'隶属关系','the kind of softwarePlugin'=>'插件','greetingHey %s,'=>'您好，%s，','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'选择接收有关安全与功能更新、教育内容和偶尔优惠的电子邮件通知，并共享一些基本的 WordPress 环境信息。这将帮助我们使 %s 与您的网站更兼容，并更好地满足您的需求。','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'选择接收电子邮件通知，以获取安全与功能更新、教育内容和不定期优惠，并分享一些基本的 WordPress 环境信息。','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'如果您跳过这一步也没关系！%1$s 仍能正常运行。','Allow & Continue'=>'允许并继续','verbSkip'=>'跳过','Skipping, please wait'=>'正在跳过，请稍候','Continue'=>'继续','Please wait'=>'请稍候','as activating pluginActivating'=>'正在激活','This will allow %s to'=>'这允许 %s','Privacy Policy'=>'隐私政策','Terms of Service'=>'服务条款','License Agreement'=>'许可协议','Have a license key?'=>'我有许可证密钥？','Activate License'=>'激活许可证','View Basic Profile Info'=>'查看基本个人资料信息','Your WordPress user\'s: first & last name, and email address'=>'您的 WordPress 用户的名字、姓氏和电子邮箱地址','View Basic Website Info'=>'查看基本网站信息','Homepage URL & title, WP & PHP versions, and site language'=>'主页网址和标题、WP 及 PHP 版本以