o not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'插件在您的页面上输出的每个类名都以此前缀开头，这样页面就不会暴露是哪个插件构建的。1 到 8 个小写字母或数字，且必须以字母开头。','Beta updates'=>'Beta 更新','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'本网站接收测试版更新。','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'本网站仅接收稳定版本。','Change this on the Account page'=>'请在“账户”页面上更改此设置','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'测试版提供给已连接至其账户的授权 Pro 安装版。连接后，您可以从“账户”页面加入。','Save settings'=>'保存设置','Add a second language under Tranzly in the admin menu, and the switcher appears here.'=>'在管理菜单的 Tranzly 下添加第二种语言，切换器就会显示在这里。','Switcher'=>'切换器','Accessible label'=>'辅助功能标签','block titleLanguage switcher'=>'语言切换器','block descriptionLinks to this page in each of the site\'s languages. It renders nothing until two or more languages are listed.'=>'指向该网站各个语言版本的此页链接。在列出两个或更多语言之前，它不呈现任何内容。','block keywordlanguage'=>'语言','block keywordswitcher'=>'切换器','block keywordtranslation'=>'翻译']];